<title>USA: American Eco says hires Coopers &amp; Lybrand.</title>
<headline>American Eco says hires Coopers &amp; Lybrand.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Eco Corp said Wednesday it has hired Coopers &amp; Lybrand as its independent auditing and accounting firm.</p>
<p>&quot;The appointment of Coopers &amp; Lybrand is in response to the investment community's desire to have public companies of our size audited by an internationally recognized accounting firm,&quot; said American Eco chief financial officer David Norris.</p>
</text>
